WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.593
Welcome to Orbit. Choose your favourite. Our focus is Comparatives and superlatives.

2
00:00:07.593 --> 00:00:15.972
Use a comparative plus than to compare two things. Use the plus a superlative to compare one thing with a whole group.

3
00:00:15.972 --> 00:00:19.186
My new desk is bigger than my old one.

4
00:00:19.186 --> 00:00:22.515
Model B has a better battery than Model A.

5
00:00:22.515 --> 00:00:25.904
This is the most interesting book in the library.

6
00:00:25.904 --> 00:00:35.302
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
